		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>One-Quarter Tank Fuel Regulation:</strong> Maintain a quarter tank of fuel in your car, as it helps in preventing fuel line freeze during colder climates. This regulation also ensures a smooth loading process and reduced risks during transportation.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>FASTag Management:</strong> If your vehicle is equipped with a FASTag (Fastag), ensure it is properly installed and activated before the transport. This will facilitate seamless toll payment during the journey.</span></li>
